  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 50060b8dc62b41a419acff01334cb145, type: 3}
  m_Name: DLG_SEQ07_PeopleOfCebu
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Bayani.Story.DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: NARRATION
    text: "Kai is discovered by locals. Their eyes catch the strange clothing \u2014
      fabrics with no year they know."
  - speaker: NARRATION
    text: Kai tries to explain who he is. Nobody believes him.
  - speaker: NARRATION
    text: He is brought toward the settlement. Foreign visitors. Local leaders. Trade.
      Gifts. Different languages. Different beliefs.
  - speaker: NARRATION
    text: 'A port at full work: bangka fleets, hammered outriggers, gold and cotton,
      courts that speak in trade-metaphors.'
  - speaker: KAI
    text: This isn't simply a battle. It is a moment when two worlds are meeting
      for the first time.
